e youngest son and his bride do not come home, and in the morning, a ransom note arrives. The ransom is so high that the family is forced not only to sell its small business, but also to seek help from its fellow tribesmen."},{"language":"ru-RU","title":"Теснота","overview":"1998 год, Нальчик. Илана — девочка-подросток из хорошей семьи, которая всё делает наоборот. Перечит матери. Спорит с отцом. Чинит машины в автомастерской, не вылезая из спецодежды. Встречается с парнем, который не нравится её родителям. Пацанка и красавица, она идёт своим путём и жаждет свободы, но когда в доме происходит страшная трагедия, именно Илана оказывается единственной, кто способен спасти семью. Однако какой ценой?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/omaiQ2envK9GvWhuVzJbIdvn0yP.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nbggZoZHJLOUdwAHUQ7Ce2aOHsd.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":452008,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/omaiQ2envK9GvWhuVzJbIdvn0yP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/omaiQ2envK9GvWhuVzJbIdvn0yP.jpg","language":"it","width":640,"height":960},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/omaiQ2envK9GvWhuVzJbIdvn0yP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/omaiQ2envK9GvWhuVzJbIdvn0yP.jpg","language":"it","width":640,"height":960},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xAF2N0SbvjmMQcz8ATG3K4jsLUT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xAF2N0SbvjmMQcz8ATG3K4jsLUT.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2in3p9uaX6ClqkMS8Oci69LCsXP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2in3p9uaX6ClqkMS8Oci69LCsXP.jpg","language":